%N A399331 The binomial matrix of the Euler tangent numbers, square array read by ascending antidiagonals.
%C A399331 See the comments and links in A399000.
%H A399331 Peter Luschny, <a href="https://github.com/PeterLuschny/Gists/blob/main/GnomonicExpansionAndBinomialMatrices.ipynb">Gnomonic Expansion and Binomial Matrices</a>, a Python notebook.
%F A399331 A(n, n) = T(n) := 2^n*Euler(n, 1) if n is odd, otherwise 0.
%F A399331 A(n, k) = Sum_{m=0..d} binomial(d, m) * s^(d - m) * T(p + m), where d = abs(n - k), p = min(n, k), s = 1 if k <= n, otherwise -1.
